// Title: Remote Access Tool - Team Viewer Session Started On Windows Host
// Rule ID: ab70c354-d9ac-4e11-bbb6-ec8e3b153357
// Severity: low
// Tags: attack.persistence, attack.initial-access, attack.t1133
// Category: process_creation
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: microsoft_xdr
// Source: /home/user/Sigma_KQL/sigma_rules/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_remote_access_tools_teamviewer_incoming_connection.yml
//
// Generated by sigma-to-kql converter
